(7702623, 1264297, 67258, '<td valign="top">That drop!</td>', 'That drop!', '2021-10-05 15:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702624, 1264570, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a simple concept - and how very well executed.</td>', 'What a simple concept - and how very well executed.', '2021-10-05 15:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702626, 1264492, 67258, '<td valign="top">I do like this, but there is something a bit strange going on with the skin tones, especially on the faces - like you have tried to recover too much shadow detail.  But what lovely, quiet fun this pair are having.</td>', 'I do like this, but there is something a bit strange going on with the skin tones, especially on the faces - like you have tried to recover too much shadow detail.  But what lovely, quiet fun this pair are having.', '2021-10-05 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702629, 1264596, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog invent grate masheen for fishing. Scoops up fishes and puts fish in box for bring back to tribe. Problem uv vershun 1 is curcling scoop thing also chops up fish. But Grog is smart and solve problem by inventing chunk lite toona.</td>', 'Grog invent grate masheen for fishing. Scoops up fishes and puts fish in box for bring back to tribe. Problem uv vershun 1 is curcling scoop thing also chops up fish. But Grog is smart and solve problem by inventing chunk lite toona.', '2021-10-05 16:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702630, 1264509, 83313, '<td valign="top">Younglings of tribe of Grog hide mammoth jurky in pokets to have for midnite snak and keep from Thag eeting. Thag luvs jurky, is big jurk to take jurky from younglings.</td>', 'Younglings of tribe of Grog hide mammoth jurky in pokets to have for midnite snak and keep from Thag eeting. Thag luvs jurky, is big jurk to take jurky from younglings.', '2021-10-05 16:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702773, 1264655, 67258, '<td valign="top">Woah!  That is one heck of an interesting perspective.  You have given me something that I haven''t seen before, and it is really, really good. 9.</td>', 'Woah!  That is one heck of an interesting perspective.  You have given me something that I haven''t seen before, and it is really, really good. 9.', '2021-10-07 08:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702774, 1264611, 67258, '<td valign="top">Brings to mind the art of Edward Bourne-Jones - or perhaps Millais.  Beautifully lit, composed and presented, but something, for this viewer is just slightly out of kilter - I can''t put my finger on it, but will revisit.  7.  <br/> <br/>Edit - I still can''t work out what it is that stops me giving this full marks - it is so artfully and carefully crafted, and yet there remains something just very slightly off.  I wonder if it is to do with the sense of balance - that my brain wants a little more space to the left and less to the right. Nonetheless, bumping to 8.</td>', 'Brings to mind the art of Edward Bourne-Jones - or perhaps Millais.  Beautifully lit, composed and presented, but something, for this viewer is just slightly out of kilter - I can''t put my finger on it, but will revisit.  7.   Edit - I still can''t work out what it is that stops me giving this full marks - it is so artfully and carefully crafted, and yet there remains something just very slightly off.  I wonder if it is to do with the sense of balance - that my brain wants a little more space to the left and less to the right. Nonetheless, bumping to 8.', '2021-10-07 08:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702775, 1264606, 67258, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. Bumping to 8.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. Bumping to 8.', '2021-10-07 08:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702776, 1264582, 67258, '<td valign="top">The pier structure doesn''t look strong enough to withstand the elements.  A well composed, interesting photo.</td>', 'The pier structure doesn''t look strong enough to withstand the elements.  A well composed, interesting photo.', '2021-10-07 08:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702777, 1264664, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautiful study with lovely tones. I wish the background was just vegetation - the white patch (window?) does draw the eye.</td>', 'Beautiful study with lovely tones. I wish the background was just vegetation - the white patch (window?) does draw the eye.', '2021-10-07 08:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
