(7702801, 1264611, 3306, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait. One of my favorites.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait. One of my favorites.', '2021-10-07 20:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702802, 1264477, 3306, '<td valign="top">Father and son! Outstanding lighting and focus. Wonderful nature shot.</td>', 'Father and son! Outstanding lighting and focus. Wonderful nature shot.', '2021-10-07 20:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702803, 1264597, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice find and nicely composed.</td>', 'Nice find and nicely composed.', '2021-10-07 20:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702804, 1264632, 138630, '<td valign="top">My favorite and 10.  The water droplets that continue the lines of the bird . . . or the curve of the bird''s neck,back,legs,feet that continue the lines of the droplets . . . take this to another level entirely.<br/>That I could use just a tad more detail on the topmost part of the wings is irrelevant.</td>', 'My favorite and 10.  The water droplets that continue the lines of the bird . . . or the curve of the bird''s neck,back,legs,feet that continue the lines of the droplets . . . take this to another level entirely.That I could use just a tad more detail on the topmost part of the wings is irrelevant.', '2021-10-07 21:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702805, 1264611, 138630, '<td valign="top">That this is a photograph is both hard to believe and completely believable.  What a beautiful dress, model, setting.  It''s an old Master''s that I''ve somehow missed all these years.  Some may find the face slightly over-processed - for me, it''s perfection.  9+</td>', 'That this is a photograph is both hard to believe and completely believable.  What a beautiful dress, model, setting.  It''s an old Master''s that I''ve somehow missed all these years.  Some may find the face slightly over-processed - for me, it''s perfection.  9+', '2021-10-07 21:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702806, 1264491, 138630, '<td valign="top">Amazing light, color, moment.  I really like the minimalist subject and the way the fence crosses the frame at a diagonal.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Amazing light, color, moment.  I really like the minimalist subject and the way the fence crosses the frame at a diagonal.  Beautiful.', '2021-10-07 21:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702807, 1264605, 138630, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen these stairs before and I am amazed every time.  Sooo many shapes and lines and patterns to enjoy in this beautiful, nested piece.</td>', 'I''ve seen these stairs before and I am amazed every time.  Sooo many shapes and lines and patterns to enjoy in this beautiful, nested piece.', '2021-10-07 21:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702808, 1264531, 138630, '<td valign="top">I''m never anywhere to try long exposures like this and am always captivated by them.  How perfectly you have managed to place the moon - not to suggest that you moved it, but rather to admire your persistence in looking for and finding just the right perspective.</td>', 'I''m never anywhere to try long exposures like this and am always captivated by them.  How perfectly you have managed to place the moon - not to suggest that you moved it, but rather to admire your persistence in looking for and finding just the right perspective.', '2021-10-07 21:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702809, 1264147, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  I especially enjoy the layers that the skyline and lights beyond in the top third add to the scene.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  I especially enjoy the layers that the skyline and lights beyond in the top third add to the scene.', '2021-10-07 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702810, 1264663, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is terrific.  So well seen.  Love the way the shapes and colors and textures fit together like so many pieces of a well-designed jigsaw puzzle.  I only wish the lone stone was not cut off.</td>', 'This is terrific.  So well seen.  Love the way the shapes and colors and textures fit together like so many pieces of a well-designed jigsaw puzzle.  I only wish the lone stone was not cut off.', '2021-10-07 21:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702811, 1264568, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great and fitting title and I love the light and bokeh.  Just figured out the bottom - he''s singing in (or on??) the bath!  I think that excuses the "cut-off" tail - bumping to an 8.</td>', 'Great and fitting title and I love the light and bokeh.  Just figured out the bottom - he''s singing in (or on??) the bath!  I think that excuses the "cut-off" tail - bumping to an 8.', '2021-10-07 21:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702812, 1264577, 138630, '<td valign="top">Wowza on the colors and textures - Oh MY!! for sure!  Love the lattice pattern on the left and the way it balances all the stripes.</td>', 'Wowza on the colors and textures - Oh MY!! for sure!  Love the lattice pattern on the left and the way it balances all the stripes.', '2021-10-07 21:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702814, 1264655, 138630, '<td valign="top">Dizzying perspective and the taxis (and complete absence of other vehicles) take this up a notch.</td>', 'Dizzying perspective and the taxis (and complete absence of other vehicles) take this up a notch.', '2021-10-07 21:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702815, 1264297, 138630, '<td valign="top">Fantastic closeup of this bug . . . I doubt I would like him, but I must admire his colors and the cut and design of his outfit.  And that water droplet!!</td>', 'Fantastic closeup of this bug . . . I doubt I would like him, but I must admire his colors and the cut and design of his outfit.  And that water droplet!!', '2021-10-07 21:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702817, 1264594, 138630, '<td valign="top">Cool catch - yours and the bird''s.  Nice focus, light, and colors.</td>', 'Cool catch - yours and the bird''s.  Nice focus, light, and colors.', '2021-10-07 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702818, 1264650, 138630, '<td valign="top">It''s always hard for me to reconcile the funny, flattened spoon-shaped bill with the grace of the neck, body, and wings and the beautiful pink color.  Nice in-flight capture.</td>', 'It''s always hard for me to reconcile the funny, flattened spoon-shaped bill with the grace of the neck, body, and wings and the beautiful pink color.  Nice in-flight capture.', '2021-10-07 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702819, 1264648, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the tones, the scene, the composition, the moon.  It''s softer than I might want.</td>', 'I love the tones, the scene, the composition, the moon.  It''s softer than I might want.', '2021-10-07 21:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702820, 1264528, 138630, '<td valign="top">Masterful lighting.  Beautiful model, lovely tones.  Seductive.</td>', 'Masterful lighting.  Beautiful model, lovely tones.  Seductive.', '2021-10-07 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702821, 1264312, 138630, '<td valign="top">Superb details - this one is ready to cut and bring in to enjoy (or to leave on the bush and to enjoy there).</td>', 'Superb details - this one is ready to cut and bring in to enjoy (or to leave on the bush and to enjoy there).', '2021-10-07 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702822, 1264545, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great catch - bet you were wishing for a bit more space on the right.</td>', 'Great catch - bet you were wishing for a bit more space on the right.', '2021-10-07 21:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702823, 1264355, 138630, '<td valign="top">The light and maybe the conversion give this a lacy, etch-like look that is very appealing.  Love the curve of the trunk and the way you''ve positioned it in the frame.</td>', 'The light and maybe the conversion give this a lacy, etch-like look that is very appealing.  Love the curve of the trunk and the way you''ve positioned it in the frame.', '2021-10-07 21:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702826, 1264477, 103142, '<td valign="top">So beautiful!!! Is this Sara with her new lens?</td>', 'So beautiful!!! Is this Sara with her new lens?', '2021-10-07 22:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
