(7702828, 1264594, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Nice catch, good exposure. I wish there was a little more space on the left hand sie and a tad on the top. It seems a little squished. -8-</td>', 'Wonderful! Nice catch, good exposure. I wish there was a little more space on the left hand sie and a tad on the top. It seems a little squished. -8-', '2021-10-07 22:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
