(7702830, 1264339, 103142, '<td valign="top">Holy cow!! Never seen that before! Did it get away? What happened?I would have liked a little more space above, it seems a bit squished. And it''s too bad about the placement of the reed. But that''s not something you can control.</td>', 'Holy cow!! Never seen that before! Did it get away? What happened?I would have liked a little more space above, it seems a bit squished. And it''s too bad about the placement of the reed. But that''s not something you can control.', '2021-10-07 22:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702831, 1264568, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love your birds. they''re so beautiful. I wish we had such good looking birds!!</td>', 'I love your birds. they''re so beautiful. I wish we had such good looking birds!!', '2021-10-07 22:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
