(7702834, 1264606, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sublime in its textures, tones, palette and mood, as the title confirms.  Full of evanescent hints and a promising blossom, and hopeful lighting from below.  The diagonally established halves, approximately, pleasingly mingle with each other, a tricky balance.  It feels like this image is straight from the heart.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Sublime in its textures, tones, palette and mood, as the title confirms.  Full of evanescent hints and a promising blossom, and hopeful lighting from below.  The diagonally established halves, approximately, pleasingly mingle with each other, a tricky balance.  It feels like this image is straight from the heart.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-10-07 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702835, 1264588, 138630, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and detail on the monarch.  I am going to miss them so much.</td>', 'Excellent focus and detail on the monarch.  I am going to miss them so much.', '2021-10-07 22:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
