(7702849, 1264592, 173844, '<td valign="top">The tender intimacy of people talking like this is almost intolerably powerful.  Was grain ever used more artfully to create the feel of a painting?  Wonderfully rich tones in this black and white.  All the elements work together so well to render the fullness of life.<br/>Another favorite.</td>', 'The tender intimacy of people talking like this is almost intolerably powerful.  Was grain ever used more artfully to create the feel of a painting?  Wonderfully rich tones in this black and white.  All the elements work together so well to render the fullness of life.Another favorite.', '2021-10-07 23:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
