(7702855, 1264568, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great title for this lovely image.  Hard not to anthropomorphize, as this bird seems just so joyful.  The bokeh is evidence of beauty and happiness.</td>', 'Great title for this lovely image.  Hard not to anthropomorphize, as this bird seems just so joyful.  The bokeh is evidence of beauty and happiness.', '2021-10-07 23:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702861, 1264650, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here comes magic, all pink and odd.  I like how the symmetry is obscured by the angle of the capture.  Lovely background, too.  The profligate abundance of nature, unhindered, is overwhelming.</td>', 'Here comes magic, all pink and odd.  I like how the symmetry is obscured by the angle of the capture.  Lovely background, too.  The profligate abundance of nature, unhindered, is overwhelming.', '2021-10-07 23:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702867, 1264632, 173844, '<td valign="top">Another superb image of a bird, piling riches onto this site.  Even without the curve of trailing droplets this would be terrific, but we''ll happily enjoy the cherry on the sundae.  The subtle, murky background adds additional atmosphere.  Is there no end to this beauty?  Makes me feel like tossing my camera in the dumpster.</td>', 'Another superb image of a bird, piling riches onto this site.  Even without the curve of trailing droplets this would be terrific, but we''ll happily enjoy the cherry on the sundae.  The subtle, murky background adds additional atmosphere.  Is there no end to this beauty?  Makes me feel like tossing my camera in the dumpster.', '2021-10-07 23:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702868, 1264509, 173844, '<td valign="top">Won over by precious, and as your title notes, it''s a real pleasure to imagine their lives playing out together.  Warm wishes.</td>', 'Won over by precious, and as your title notes, it''s a real pleasure to imagine their lives playing out together.  Warm wishes.', '2021-10-07 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702871, 1264477, 173844, '<td valign="top">How interesting that, however excellent the depiction of the foreground doe, it''s the background that carries the weight of the image.  The calling buck energizes the whole.</td>', 'How interesting that, however excellent the depiction of the foreground doe, it''s the background that carries the weight of the image.  The calling buck energizes the whole.', '2021-10-07 23:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702872, 1264491, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely lines, tones and composition.  The  building atmosphere suggests the day to come, which could lead anywhere.  Emotionally rewarding.</td>', 'Lovely lines, tones and composition.  The  building atmosphere suggests the day to come, which could lead anywhere.  Emotionally rewarding.', '2021-10-07 23:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
