(7702886, 1264582, 173844, '<td valign="top">Is this rage or fury?  Well, never mind.  It certainly highlights the raw power of nature in combination, and maybe at odds, with the well-ordered constructions of people.  The precise clarity itself is formidable.  I especially like the tiny city skyscrapers on the left horizon.</td>', 'Is this rage or fury?  Well, never mind.  It certainly highlights the raw power of nature in combination, and maybe at odds, with the well-ordered constructions of people.  The precise clarity itself is formidable.  I especially like the tiny city skyscrapers on the left horizon.', '2021-10-08 00:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
