(7702933, 1264339, 175442, '<td valign="top">Some have asked what happened to the chipmunk. Well, sadly he became the herons lunch. My neighbor has a bird feeder that has been attracting a lot of wildlife this year and this guy seemed to return daily to hunt for food. I never knew that rodents were consumed by these birds and it was very unexpected. It also was seen eating mice as well. Ah, the circle of life!</td>', 'Some have asked what happened to the chipmunk. Well, sadly he became the herons lunch. My neighbor has a bird feeder that has been attracting a lot of wildlife this year and this guy seemed to return daily to hunt for food. I never knew that rodents were consumed by these birds and it was very unexpected. It also was seen eating mice as well. Ah, the circle of life!', '2021-10-08 07:33:56.000000', NULL, 0),
