(7703048, 1264339, 4008, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mlu:</b></div><hr/><i> Some have asked what happened to the chipmunk. Well, sadly he became the herons lunch. My neighbor has a bird feeder that has been attracting a lot of wildlife this year and this guy seemed to return daily to hunt for food. I never knew that rodents were consumed by these birds and it was very unexpected. It also was seen eating mice as well. Ah, the circle of life! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They even kill and eat large rats (plenty of such video''s on youtube)</td>', 'Originally posted by mlu: Some have asked what happened to the chipmunk. Well, sadly he became the herons lunch. My neighbor has a bird feeder that has been attracting a lot of wildlife this year and this guy seemed to return daily to hunt for food. I never knew that rodents were consumed by these birds and it was very unexpected. It also was seen eating mice as well. Ah, the circle of life!   They even kill and eat large rats (plenty of such video''s on youtube)', '2021-10-10 05:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
